@endpoint = https://localhost:44339

### POST example
POST {{endpoint}}/api/echo HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "here"
}

### OPTIONS example (webhook validation request)
OPTIONS {{endpoint}}/api/echo HTTP/1.1
WebHook-Request-Origin: eventemitter.example.com
WebHook-Request-Rate: 120

### HEAD example
HEAD {{endpoint}}/api/echo HTTP/1.1

### MCP: list tools
POST {{endpoint}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list"}

### MCP: call echo tool
POST {{endpoint}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"echo","arguments":{"message":"hello"}}}

### MCP: call get_request_info tool
POST {{endpoint}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_request_info","arguments":{}}}

### Page view to cause echo
GET {{endpoint}}/pages/echo HTTP/1.1

### Page view with cache
GET {{endpoint}}/pages/echocache

### Page view with cache
GET {{endpoint}}/pages/echocache
X-Custom: ABC
If-None-Match: QUJD

### Forwarded host
GET {{endpoint}}/
X-FORWARDED-PROTO: http
X-FORWARDED-PORT: 80
X-Forwarded-Host: contoso.northeurope.cloudapp.azure.com
